      "Works_Summary_JP": "創作世界の各国に所在する誇り高き８人の義兄弟姉妹。\n「豹変系女子」のアンソロジーにあたり、主に八徳に基づいた８人のキャラクターからなる。",
      "Works_Summary_EN": "Proudly residing across nations in the creative world, eight virtuous siblings.\nIt is an anthology of 'Sinister Changing Girls' and mainly consists of eight characters based on the eight virtues.",
